# Environment variables for Claude Skills
# Copy relevant variables to your shell profile or launchd plist.
#
# Most variables are OPTIONAL — scripts auto-detect sensible defaults.
# Required variables are marked with (required).

# Path to your Obsidian vault root.
# Default: auto-detected by walking up from the script location to find .obsidian/
# VAULT_DIR=/path/to/your/vault

# Your primary email address (the one on your calendar invites).
# Used to filter yourself out of meeting attendee lists.
# (required for calendar sync and conversation extraction to work correctly)
# PKM_USER_EMAIL=you@example.com

# Alternate email address (e.g., a Google Apps alias).
# Used for conversation deduplication.
# PKM_USER_EMAIL_ALT=you@gapps.example.com

# Your display name as it appears in Slack and calendar.
# Used to identify your messages in conversation summaries.
# (required for conversation-summarizer agent)
# PKM_USER_NAME=Your Name

# Path to the uv binary (Python package runner).
# Default: auto-detected via command -v uv, then common install locations.
# UV=/path/to/uv

# Path to pkm-sync binary.
# Default: auto-detected via command -v pkm-sync.
# PKM_SYNC=/path/to/pkm-sync

# Log directory for the daily sync orchestrator.
# Default: $HOME/Library/Logs/daily-work-sync  (macOS)
# LOG_DIR=$HOME/.local/share/logs/daily-work-sync
